{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"508307","name":"风息花","desc":"蒙德地区特产 风息花","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/08/75610764/c568cbd94910d28e297c2dfce9e1351d_4930160117339493338.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"material_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"name\":\"风息花\",\"img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/08/75610764/c568cbd94910d28e297c2dfce9e1351d_2228368378015465185.png\",\"materials\":{\"key\":\"获得方式\",\"value\":\"\u003cp\u003e野外采集；\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"描述\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e瑰秀却不失清润的花朵，主要生长在蒙德北方。花香明澈悠长，是用来调香的主要原料之一。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e在荆夫港的民话中，最初的风息花受诞于风之主的琴歌。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e传说，大地仍苍白如骨的年代里，那位行走于凡人之中的神明就是这样抚平了雪覆的伤痛，又将流动的诗篇凝作瑰美的繁花，使荒芜的僻壤成为人们安居乐业的沃土。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过，即便是在当代的西风教会中，这些来自民间的说法也未被认作神明真实成就的奇迹。毕竟，正如拨奏琴弦从来不是属于何人的特权，歌唱着自由与反抗、让明花与鲜血在北境盛开、让今日的人们得以安居乐业的，亦是无数卑微的、渺小的、羸弱的无名之人。\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"主要分布\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e风车镇\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1346","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"烹饪\",\"header\":[\"料理展示\",\"烹饪材料\",\"料理效果（美味）\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"508308\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/04/06/75610764/bc329440e5a80c6f1425b5e7a647d58a_6353186696230162615.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"海港鱼鱼堡\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/508308/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/508308/detail?bbs_presentati